sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Playbook (site.yml)
    participant CR as Common Role
    participant NR as Nginx Role
    participant MR as MySQL Role
    participant H as Handler
    
    P->>CR: 1. Execute on ALL hosts
    Note over CR: Packages, Security,<br/>Timezone, Monitoring
    CR-->>P: ✓ Complete
    
    P->>NR: 2. Execute on webservers
    Note over NR: Install Nginx,<br/>Configure VHosts,<br/>Setup SSL
    NR->>H: Notify: restart nginx
    NR-->>P: ✓ Complete
    
    P->>MR: 3. Execute on dbservers
    Note over MR: Install MySQL,<br/>Create Databases,<br/>Setup Users
    MR->>H: Notify: restart mysql
    MR-->>P: ✓ Complete
    
    P->>H: 4. Run all handlers
    H-->>P: ✓ Handlers executed
    
    P->>P: 5. Post-deployment verification
